            "relation": "AFFECTED_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "northern hemisphere",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Sources of natural variability in temperature both internal (unforced random or chaotic variability) and external (radiatively forced changes due to volcanic eruptions and variations in solar irradiance) to the climate system lead to correlation between neighboring annual mean temperature values. Such correlation leads, in turn, to reduced effective degrees of freedom in the temperature time series.",
